{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Hey Nate! Yesterday was crazy cool - I wrote a few bits for a screenplay that appeared on the big screen yesterday! It was nerve-wracking but so inspiring to see my words come alive!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_15-714fd61524531a48f84679b2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:54:31.002479+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "714fd61524531a48f84679b2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "714fd61524531a48f84679b2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Congrats, Joanna! Seeing your hard work pay off like that must've felt amazing. I bet it was scary too, but awesome! You're so inspiring. By the way, last time we saw eachother, I noticed a spiderman pin on your purse. Is Spider-Man your favorite superhero, or do you have another fave?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_15-fcd421b4456f09dbbed248f5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:54:31.027253+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fcd421b4456f09dbbed248f5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fcd421b4456f09dbbed248f5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks, Nate! It was a real roller coaster, but seeing the hard work pay off was amazing. Spider-Man has always been a favorite of mine - I mean, who doesn't love Peter Parker's struggles between being a hero and being a person? But I'm kind of a sucker for any superhero - everyone has their own rad story and powers. Do you have a favorite superhero?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_15-92e236b9e600947160c1a989", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:54:31.041766+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "92e236b9e600947160c1a989", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "92e236b9e600947160c1a989", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: That's great, Joanna! Iron Man is my top pick. I love his tech and that sarcastic humor. Seeing these figures just makes me feel invincible!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_15-61dd941b4a65c00e59325b6e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:54:31.060513+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "61dd941b4a65c00e59325b6e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "61dd941b4a65c00e59325b6e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Wow, Nate! That's awesome. I love the tech and funny jokes of Iron Man too. What made you get that figure?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_15-ca9a6eefe27b8fd623b57520", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:54:31.072917+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ca9a6eefe27b8fd623b57520", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ca9a6eefe27b8fd623b57520", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Thanks Joanna! I got it because it reminded me of something I love. Its presence in my room is a good reminder to keep working on my goals. Any inspiring things in your room?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_15-9991b931ebb1d315e2aa2989", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:54:31.086066+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9991b931ebb1d315e2aa2989", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9991b931ebb1d315e2aa2989", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: My cork board is full of inspiring quotes and pictures for motivation and creativity. It's my little corner of inspiration."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_15-6024f83d7f4f9329f894cffe", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:54:31.099985+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6024f83d7f4f9329f894cffe", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6024f83d7f4f9329f894cffe", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Wow Joanna, that sounds great! Could you show me a picture of it?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_15-3f67f182af91eb19350dbee6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:54:31.113949+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3f67f182af91eb19350dbee6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3f67f182af91eb19350dbee6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Here ya go, a pic of my cork board. It's got quotes, photos, and little keepsakes."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_15-2a595083912f0c925b4196c8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:54:31.127407+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2a595083912f0c925b4196c8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2a595083912f0c925b4196c8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: That's a great pic of your family! What made you hang it on your cork board?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_15-4ec6a3a02ea995f332c844e8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:54:31.139287+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4ec6a3a02ea995f332c844e8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4ec6a3a02ea995f332c844e8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks, Nate! Having that picture on my cork board reminds me of the love and encouragement from them every day."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_15-4a145d642a42f87e6a6df023", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:54:31.150646+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4a145d642a42f87e6a6df023", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4a145d642a42f87e6a6df023", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: That's great, Joanna. Family support is invaluable. It's so good to have those reminders."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_15-b4aeaf3e1b12e2c646dcacfa", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:54:31.159616+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b4aeaf3e1b12e2c646dcacfa", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b4aeaf3e1b12e2c646dcacfa", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Absolutely, it means a lot and keeps me going."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_15-b01218de2d37c6c14f683914", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:54:31.171460+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b01218de2d37c6c14f683914", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b01218de2d37c6c14f683914", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: I really should start a cork board of my own shouldn't I. That seems like a really valuable thing!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_15-0a8718fec098a666ac47f784", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:54:31.183359+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0a8718fec098a666ac47f784", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0a8718fec098a666ac47f784", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: I would definitely recommend it! As long as your willing to explain what it is to your friends."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_15-92d7e43e65ce9602dcb9a41b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:54:31.194321+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "92d7e43e65ce9602dcb9a41b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "92d7e43e65ce9602dcb9a41b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Of course! Well see you later Joanna!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_15-c70d0835c88a3994e9140bcc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:54:31.207232+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c70d0835c88a3994e9140bcc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c70d0835c88a3994e9140bcc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Bye Nate!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-42/session_15-5343a77821f3a6713ac8beab", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:54:31.217200+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5343a77821f3a6713ac8beab", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5343a77821f3a6713ac8beab", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
